# fixedbugs, defect 2638, lane lane-pkgshadow, 2026-11-21.
#
# The issue's shape (b1): the program holds the fetched package `fq`'s
# record, whose group names `fq2636.h` with the library `fq2636`, and binds
# `FQ_SCALE` from its own `fq2636.h`, beside `main.hero`. The package's
# answer reaches this program's unit by the header's text, so its folder is
# searched before the program's own: until the repair the library's file was
# read for the program's group and the build printed `10` for the program's
# `100` at exit 0. Refused at the program's group, the package's `fq2636`
# named as the library whose answer named the folder.
use <fq>/fq

extern "fq2636.h"  #~ shadowed_header
    constant FQ_SCALE: i64

function main()
    p: fq.Pair = fq.make(a: 3, b: 4)
    print(FQ_SCALE)
    print(fq.scaled(p))
